# Vue Components & Pages

See `docs/agents/components.md` for full conventions.

- `<script setup>` with Composition API — use Nuxt UI components and Tailwind utilities
- All user-facing text via `t("key")` from `useI18n()` — add keys to both `de.json` and `en.json`
- Use `useTenantRoute()` for tenant-aware navigation links
- Load data via composables, not inline `$fetch` — prefer `useApiClient()` for API calls
- Set `definePageMeta` with layout and middleware on pages
